<div class="g38 fai">
  <div class="g38-hero">
    <h1>First Article Inspection (FAI) Guide</h1>
<p>A First Article Inspection (FAI) proves, with documented evidence, that your production process can make a part that meets every requirement on its drawing. This guide explains how to plan, complete and review an FAI report (FAIR) to the AS9102 Revision C format, in plain language, for inspectors and reviewers who are new to the process.</p>
<p>This is an explanatory guide, not a substitute for the standard. AS9102 is published by SAE International, and the requirements in the standard, your customer's purchase order, and your own company's procedures always take precedence over anything here. Where customers commonly add their own rules, this guide says so.</p>
